{"version":1,"key":"card:187","content":{"id":187,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5dd1bdcc-7d17-4661-aa37-5a80f515a797","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"坐标的变换是相对于 Canvas 坐标系统的原点而言，而不是相对于图形的左上角，如果希望相对于图形左上角做变换，可以将图形左上角的坐标设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(0, 0)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后通过平移变换移动到相应的位置，接着进行相应的变换，这时的变换就相当于是对于图形的左上角进行的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"3310aba7-8bc6-41d5-afb7-c1b6612b559c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c99c0ba-1d17-489c-84b3-1d5c2effbdb7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const theta = PI / 4\nctx.transform(cos(theta), -sin(theta), sin(theta), cos(theta), 100, 100)\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 100, 100)","collabId":"ca978247-2b41-408c-b70a-fbc08e736392","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c338fc5a-c90e-4085-a6fe-183e56c89234","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当多次调用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"transform()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"translate()"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"scale()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ， "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rotate()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等方法时，会和之前的变换进行叠加，也就是说最终的变换矩阵为之前所有变换矩阵的乘积"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6f7e6b1d-e13c-45c5-b622-7a715bf3ec5b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c49b5e1-47a9-4bb5-be7e-a6be9dab9feb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"ctx.translate(100, 100)\n// 在之前平移的基础上进行旋转\nctx.rotate(PI / 4)\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 100, 100)","collabId":"fb7b1cff-82db-42c3-93b2-38d13a313faf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63eda426-d47f-431f-8e07-b6a3e7eb0b5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"并且根据矩阵相乘的性质 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"AB \\neq BA","collabId":"1ed96bc6-54c7-490b-82dd-0d0d9752364d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AB \\eq BA"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是说最后变换的结果与变换的顺序有关，先进行平移后进行旋转与先进行旋转后进行平移，其得到的结果是不同的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"a978dfb4-48e9-486e-bfbc-30ce88ac58ca","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"de86ae8f-fdfd-4d17-846e-97ab5bf05fc5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 先进行旋转，后进行平移\nctx.rotate(PI / 4)\nctx.translate(100, 100)","collabId":"3b0c7169-cebf-46e8-84c8-359b7853b188","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Canvas/变换"],"createTime":1690384168989,"updateTime":1743303640408,"linkedCards":[{"id":183,"target":{"key":"card:183","type":"card","id":183},"summary":"在很多时候我们需要对绘制的对象进行拉伸，旋转，平移等操作，这些操作可以看做是对坐标进行了变换，在数学上的处理是对当前坐标乘以一个矩阵得到一个新的坐标，然后将新坐标表示的点绘制在画布上 其中等式左边是变换矩阵与当前坐标，右边为变换后的坐标。 ...","tags":["Canvas/变换"]},{"id":188,"target":{"key":"card:188","type":"card","id":188},"summary":"当我们通过 transform 设置变换矩阵时，它会在之前的变换基础上进行变换，如果希望不在之前的变换基础上进行变换，我们可以使用 setTransform() ，它接受的参数同 transform() ， setTransform() 做...","tags":["Canvas/变换"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640408}}